	ORG 100
	Load	A     /Load A
	Add	One   /Add 1, store result in AC
	Jump	S1    /Jump to S1
S2,	Add      One  /Add 1, store result in AC
	Store    A    /Store AC in A
	Halt          /Terminate program
S1,	Add	A     /Add A, store result in AC
	Jump	S2    /Jump to S2
A,	HEX 0023      / A = 35
One,	HEX 0001      / One = 1

